# macOS/Google Drive custom folder-icon artifacts (one of these broke `xcodebuild test`)
Icon?

# macOS custom-folder-icon markers ("Icon" followed by a carriage return).
#
# Zero-byte files whose data lives in a resource fork. The project uses
# PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup, so every file in a target's folder is a member
# automatically — these get swept into the bundle as resources and codesign then rejects
# it with "resource fork, Finder information, or similar detritus not allowed". 4,645 of
# them accumulated across the tree and broke both DerivedData trees.
Icon?
